OL,3,GNEWSABlaze involving 100 tonnes of
OL,4,Astraw breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blaze involving up to 100 tonnes of
OL,7,Fstraw in a field in Shropshire was
OL,8,Finitially in danger of spreading to
OL,9,Fother fields and trees.
OL,11,FCrews were called to the field on the
OL,12,Foutskirts of Bridgnorth, not long
OL,13,Fbefore 20:00 BST on Thursday, with
OL,14,Ftheir initial actions successfully
OL,15,Fstopping the spread.
OL,17,FShropshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,18,Fthe task was then "maintaining a
OL,19,Fcontrolled burn of the main stack",
OL,20,Fwith assistance from a farmer in
OL,21,F"turning over the stack to assist with
OL,22,Fthe burning".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
